  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> in the polynomial <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
